  "3770c700-5ed0-4a9b-9923-1b8b632c3df2"],
 " of the outputs. Categorically, this is the biproduct in additive monoidal \
categories."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"1da895f3-9229-4245-a318-3b246270482c"],

